@* A count that rolls like an odometer when it changes: the old number goes out and the new one comes in, up when it grew,
   down when it fell, flashing once (flip.js and 41-intake.css). At rest, and when first shown, it's just the number. Keyed
   by its value, so a change is a new element in the same place. *@
<span class="tide-odo"><span class="tide-roll" data-tide-tick @key="Value">@Value</span></span>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Value { get; set; } = "";
}
